GCC's runtime libraries
=======================

Lumen is built with GCC 10.2 (GCCSDK, riscos-crossdev). The parts of GCC
built into Lumen (libgcc) are under the GNU General Public License,
version 3, with the GCC Runtime Library Exception, version 3.1, which
allows programs compiled with GCC to be distributed under any licence.

